ficial-page card. Version 4 (round 4): no alert card in 신청 준비 unless asked (p01-p04, n03 relabelled; the alert is a button); n04 rewritten in a phrasing of its own (the old string matched a holdout case). c01/c02 rewritten in phrasings of their own. Version 5 (round 7, 2026-10-25 lead decision): the rules no longer refuse fraud wording (fail-open; the intent classifier's refuse class covers it), so x01/x02 are `read_only` rows: any read (a template search or none), no card, no write step, no ungrounded fact or eligibility claim (the old label is under relabel.was). Version 6 (round 10, 2026-10-26 lead decision): the journey proposes no handoff card unless the goal names it, so p01-p03 expect check, checklist and vault match with no card (p03's no-template sentence came from the form step the journey no longer plans); the old labels are under relabel.was.",
